# Step 6 fix: do NOT ignore ./static. The Dockerfile copies it
# (COPY static ./static), and it is generated by the azd prebuild hook
# (npm run build in src/web) before the image is built. Ignoring it made
# the image build unable to find the built frontend. This fix is by
# inspection only: no Docker daemon was available in Step 6, so the
# image build was not run. See ../step-06-validation.md.
.git
advisor
